   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Twist perturbation theory for the gl(4) two-site Gaudin oper\n\nSolve the **twisted** Gaudin Baxter equation perturbatively in the twist $\\varphi_k = \\varepsilon\\,\\psi_k$,\nusing the exact **untwisted** Q-functions (`GaudinSolve`, from `Gaudin/Clean/GaudinSolver.wb`)\nas the order-$\\varepsilon^0$ input.\n\nOnly Q's that are **regular** as $\\varphi\\to0$ are considered -- no blow-up. Consequently the\nansatz is *not* Matteo's monic $e^{-\\varphi_k z}\\times(\\text{poly of fixed degree } M_k)$: at finite\n$\\varphi$ a regular Q is not a polynomial, but at every order in $\\varepsilon$ it is, with degree\ngrowing with the order.\n\nScheme:\n- order $\\varepsilon^0$: $L_0 Q_k^{(0)} = 0$ -- this is `GaudinSolve[S,P,mu]`, degrees $d_k=(S+P)-\\mu_k+(k-1)$.\n- order $\\varepsilon^n$: $L_0 Q_k^{(n)} = -\\sum_{m<n} L_{n-m} Q_k^{(m)}$, linear in $(Q_k^{(n)}, h^{(n)})$.\n\nAll four branches are solved **jointly** at each order: the $h$'s are shared state data, only the\n$Q_k$ are per-branch.\n\nSites $w_1=0$, $w_2=1$. Reps $\\lambda_1=[S,S,0,0]$, $\\lambda_2=[P,P,0,0]$, output irrep $\\mu$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Part 1 -- machinery copied from `Gaudin/Clean/GaudinSolver.wb`\n\nCopied verbatim (self-contained notebook convention, same as `GaudinSolver.wb` itself did from\n`baxter_SU4_L2_XXX.wb`). Argument convention throughout: `(S,P,mu)`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[schur, tensorDecomp, dimGL4, irreps];\n\nschur[lam_, x_List] := Cancel[Det[Table[x[[i]]^(lam[[j]] + Length[x] - j), {i, Length[x]}, {j, Length[x]}]]/Det[Table[x[[i]]^(Length[x] - j), {i, Length[x]}, {j, Length[x]}]]];\n\ndimGL4[lam_] := Product[(lam[[i]] - lam[[j]] + j - i)/(j - i), {i, 4}, {j, i + 1, 4}];\n\ntensorDecomp[lam_, mu_] := Module[{x = Array[xx, 4], prod, rules, nu, mult, out = {}},\n   prod = Expand[schur[lam, x] schur[mu, x]];\n   While[prod =!= 0, rules = Association[CoefficientRules[prod, x]]; nu = Last[Sort[Keys[rules]]];\n     mult = rules[nu]; AppendTo[out, nu -> mult]; prod = Expand[prod - mult schur[nu, x]]];\n   out];\n\nirreps[S_, P_] := tensorDecomp[{S, S, 0, 0}, {P, P, 0, 0}][[All, 1]];\n\n(* --- Casimirs and untwisted Q-degrees --- *)\nClearAll[muhat, xw, Pw, Cas2, Cas4, degQ];\nmuhat[mu_] := Table[mu[[i]] + 4 - i, {i, 4}];\nxw[mu_] := Table[mu[[i]] + 5/2 - i, {i, 4}];\nPw[mu_, k_] := Total[xw[mu]^k];\nCas2[mu_] := Pw[mu, 2] - 5;\nCas4[mu_] := Pw[mu, 4] + 4 Pw[mu, 3] - Pw[mu, 1] Pw[mu, 2] + Pw[mu, 2]/2 - 2 Pw[mu, 1]^2 - 10 Pw[mu, 1] - 51/4;\ndegQ[SS_, PP_, mu_] := Table[(SS + PP + 3) - muhat[mu][[k]], {k, 4}];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* --- the untwisted Gaudin ODE (leading coeff 8(z-w1)^2(z-w2)^2) --- *)\nClearAll[gaudinODE, wsub];\ngaudinODE = (2*C2 + C2^2 - 2*C4 + 24*P + 2*C2*P + 20*P^2 + 4*P^3 + 24*S + 2*C2*S + 40*P*S + 12*P^2*S + 20*S^2 + 12*P*S^2 + 4*S^3)*Q[z]\n   + 4*(C2 - 4*P - 2*P^2 - 4*S - 4*P*S - 2*S^2)*(2*z + P*z + S*z - w1 - P*w1 - w2 - S*w2)*Derivative[1][Q][z]\n   - 4*(C2*z^2 - 6*P*z^2 - 4*P^2*z^2 - 6*S*z^2 - 8*P*S*z^2 - 4*S^2*z^2 - C2*z*w1 + 8*P*z*w1 + 6*P^2*z*w1 + 4*S*z*w1 + 8*P*S*z*w1\n      + 2*S^2*z*w1 - 2*P*w1^2 - 2*P^2*w1^2 - C2*z*w2 + 4*P*z*w2 + 2*P^2*z*w2 + 8*S*z*w2 + 8*P*S*z*w2 + 6*S^2*z*w2\n      + C2*w1*w2 - 4*P*w1*w2 - 2*P^2*w1*w2 - 4*S*w1*w2 - 8*P*S*w1*w2 - 2*S^2*w1*w2 - 2*S*w2^2 - 2*S^2*w2^2)*Derivative[2][Q][z]\n   - 16*(z - w1)*(z - w2)*(P*z + S*z - P*w1 - S*w2)*Derivative[3][Q][z]\n   + 8*(z - w1)^2*(z - w2)^2*Derivative[4][Q][z];\nwsub = {w1 -> 0, w2 -> 1};\n\n(* --- untwisted solver, gauge-fixed, returns monic coefficient lists --- *)\nClearAll[GaudinSolve];\nGaudinSolve[SS_, PP_, mu_] := Module[{ds, ode},\n   ds = degQ[SS, PP, mu];\n   ode = gaudinODE /. {C2 -> Cas2[mu], C4 -> Cas4[mu], S -> SS, P -> PP} /. wsub;\n   Table[Module[{m = ds[[kk]], gauge = ds[[1 ;; kk - 1]], q, cl, sol},\n       q = Sum[cq[j] z^j, {j, 0, m}];\n       cl = CoefficientList[Expand[ode /. Q -> Function[x, q /. z -> x]], z];\n       sol = Solve[Join[Thread[cl == 0], {cq[m] == 1}, Thread[(cq /@ gauge) == 0]], Table[cq[j], {j, 0, m}]];\n       Table[cq[j], {j, 0, m}] /. sol[[1]]], {kk, 4}]];\n\n{degQ[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}], GaudinSolve[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"698091\" data-output-id=\"7\" data-out-n=\"55\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"4\" data-sub-start=\"22\" data-sub-end=\"22\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[55]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"46\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue3BtYXRyaXh9MCAmIDIgJiAzICYgNVxcXGxlZnRcezFccmlnaHRcfSAmIFxsZWZ0XHswLC0xLDFccmlnaHRcfSAmIFxsZWZ0XHswLDAsMCwxXHJpZ2h0XH0gJiBcbGVmdFx7MCwwLDAsMCwtXGZyYWN7NX17Mn0sMVxyaWdodFx9XGVuZHtwbWF0cml4fQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.41em;vertical-align:-0.955em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.455em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.615em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.405em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.955em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.455em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.615em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.405em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.955em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.455em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.615em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.405em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.955em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.455em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.615em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.405em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.955em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
