  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Part 2 -- Matteo's twisted Baxter operator, ported\n\nFrom `Paul/Python/SU4_Paul_Normalisation_EXPLICIT.wl` (his `h`'s, `eps1..eps4`, `F`, `eps1S..eps4S`,\n`BaxOp`), rewritten in our symbols. Note his `BaxOp` is the *conjugate* of the bare oper by\n$F=(z-w_1)^{-S}(z-w_2)^{-P}$ (with his `C1=C2=1`): indeed $\\mathrm{BaxOp}[Q]=F^{-1}\\,O[F\\,Q]$,\nwhich is exactly what his `eps_aS` shift formulas encode.\n\nNine `h`'s are left unknown by the reps alone -- `h24, h33, h34, h36, h43, h44, h45, h46, h48` --\njust as in his `SolveBaxAll`. Twists enter as $\\varphi_k=\\varepsilon\\,\\psi_k$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[hRep, ee1, ee2, ee3, ee4, ee1S, ee2S, ee3S, ee4S, FF, lg, BaxTw, hUnknowns, psi, ph];\n\n(* rep-dependent h's (his lines 88-100) *)\nhRep[1][r_] := r[[1]] + r[[2]] + r[[3]] + r[[4]];\nhRep[2][r_] := r[[3]] (-1 + r[[4]]) + r[[2]] (-2 + r[[3]] + r[[4]]) + r[[1]] (-3 + r[[2]] + r[[3]] + r[[4]]);\nhRep[3][r_] := r[[2]] (-1 + r[[3]]) (-2 + r[[4]]) + r[[1]] ((-2 + r[[3]]) (-3 + r[[4]]) + r[[2]] (-4 + r[[3]] + r[[4]]));\nhRep[4][r_] := r[[1]] (-1 + r[[2]]) (-2 + r[[3]]) (-3 + r[[4]]);\n\nhUnknowns = {h24, h33, h34, h36, h43, h44, h45, h46, h48};\n\n(* twists: phi_k = eps * psi_k *)\nph = Table[eps psi[k], {k, 4}];\n\n(* BaxTw[rep1,rep2,repAll] : the twisted operator as an expression in Q[z] and its derivatives *)\nBaxTw[rep1_, rep2_, repAll_] := Module[{e1phi, e2phi, e3phi, e4phi, h23, h35, h47, e1, e2, e3, e4, F, L, s1S, s2S, s3S, s4S},\n   e1phi = Total[ph];\n   e2phi = Sum[ph[[i]] ph[[j]], {i, 4}, {j, i + 1, 4}];\n   e3phi = Sum[ph[[i]] ph[[j]] ph[[k]], {i, 4}, {j, i + 1, 4}, {k, j + 1, 4}];\n   e4phi = Times @@ ph;\n   (* repAll-dependent relations (his lines 124-130) *)\n   h23 = -h24 + Sum[(Total[ph] - ph[[i]]) repAll[[i]], {i, 4}];\n   h35 = -h36 + ph[[3]] ph[[4]] (repAll[[1]] + repAll[[2]]) + ph[[2]] ph[[4]] (repAll[[1]] + repAll[[3]]) + ph[[1]] ph[[4]] (repAll[[2]] + repAll[[3]]) + ph[[2]] ph[[3]] (repAll[[1]] + repAll[[4]]) + ph[[1]] ph[[3]] (repAll[[2]] + repAll[[4]]) + ph[[1]] ph[[2]] (repAll[[3]] + repAll[[4]]);\n   h47 = -h48 + ph[[2]] ph[[3]] ph[[4]] repAll[[1]] + ph[[1]] ph[[3]] ph[[4]] repAll[[2]] + ph[[1]] ph[[2]] ph[[4]] repAll[[3]] + ph[[1]] ph[[2]] ph[[3]] repAll[[4]];\n   e1 = hRep[1][rep1]/(z - w1) + hRep[1][rep2]/(z - w2) + e1phi;\n   e2 = hRep[2][rep1]/(z - w1)^2 + hRep[2][rep2]/(z - w2)^2 + h23/(z - w1) + h24/(z - w2) + e2phi;\n   e3 = hRep[3][rep1]/(z - w1)^3 + hRep[3][rep2]/(z - w2)^3 + h33/(z - w1)^2 + h34/(z - w2)^2 + h35/(z - w1) + h36/(z - w2) + e3phi;\n   e4 = hRep[4][rep1]/(z - w1)^4 + hRep[4][rep2]/(z - w2)^4 + h43/(z - w1)^3 + h44/(z - w2)^3 + h45/(z - w1)^2 + h46/(z - w2)^2 + h47/(z - w1) + h48/(z - w2) + e4phi;\n   (* F = (z-w1)^-rep1[[1]] (z-w2)^-rep2[[1]]  (his C1=C2=1); L[n] = F^(n)/F *)\n   F[x_] := (x - w1)^(-rep1[[1]]) (x - w2)^(-rep2[[1]]);\n   L[n_] := Simplify[D[F[x], {x, n}]/F[x]] /. x -> z;\n   s1S = e1 + 4 L[1];\n   s2S = e2 + 3 e1 L[1] + 6 L[2];\n   s3S = e3 + 2 e2 L[1] + 3 e1 L[2] + 4 L[3];\n   s4S = e4 + e3 L[1] + e2 L[2] + e1 L[3] + L[4];\n   Derivative[4][Q][z] + s1S Derivative[3][Q][z] + s2S Derivative[2][Q][z] + s3S Derivative[1][Q][z] + s4S Q[z]];\n\n(* sanity: the Q''' coefficient at zero twist should be -2S/(z-w1) - 2P/(z-w2) *)\nSimplify[Coefficient[BaxTw[{S, S, 0, 0}, {P, P, 0, 0}, {m1, m2, m3, m4}], Derivative[3][Q][z]] /. eps -> 0]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"698091\" data-output-id=\"8\" data-out-n=\"64\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"6\" data-sub-start=\"37\" data-sub-end=\"37\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[64]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"46\" data-latex-b64=\"XGZyYWN7MlwsXGxlZnQoUFwsXGxlZnQoei13MVxyaWdodCkrU1wsXGxlZnQoei13MlxyaWdodClccmlnaHQpfXtcbGVmdCh3MS16XHJpZ2h0KVwsXGxlZnQoei13MlxyaWdodCl9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02691em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.04398em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\"