   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Task 0 gate\n\nAt $\\varepsilon=0$, `BaxTw` multiplied by $8(z-w_1)^2(z-w_2)^2$ must reduce **identically** to\n`gaudinODE` with $C_2\\to\\mathrm{Cas2}(\\mu)$, $C_4\\to\\mathrm{Cas4}(\\mu)$. Solving that match for the\nnine unknown `h`'s simultaneously gives the $h\\leftrightarrow$ Casimir dictionary. Done fully\nsymbolically in $S,P,\\mu,w_1,w_2$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[bax0, target0, diff0, num0, eqs0, sol0];\n\nbax0 = BaxTw[{S, S, 0, 0}, {P, P, 0, 0}, {m1, m2, m3, m4}] /. eps -> 0;\ntarget0 = gaudinODE /. {C2 -> Cas2[{m1, m2, m3, m4}], C4 -> Cas4[{m1, m2, m3, m4}]};\n\ndiff0 = Together[8 (z - w1)^2 (z - w2)^2 bax0 - target0];\nnum0 = Expand[Numerator[diff0]];\n\neqs0 = Flatten[CoefficientList[Coefficient[num0, #], z] & /@ {Q[z], Derivative[1][Q][z], Derivative[2][Q][z], Derivative[3][Q][z], Derivative[4][Q][z]}];\neqs0 = DeleteCases[Expand[eqs0], 0];\n\nPrint[\"non-trivial matching equations: \", Length[eqs0]];\nsol0 = Solve[Thread[eqs0 == 0], hUnknowns];\nPrint[\"solution branches: \", Length[sol0]];\nIf[Length[sol0] > 0, Print[\"residual after substitution: \", Simplify[num0 /. sol0[[1]]]]];\nIf[Length[sol0] > 0, Column[Simplify[# -> (# /. sol0[[1]])] & /@ hUnknowns]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">non-trivial matching equations: </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"46\" data-latex-b64=\"MTU=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
