   "value": "## Part 3 -- the order-by-order solver\n\nUnknowns at order $n$: the coefficients of $Q_k^{(n)}$ for **all four branches**, plus the nine\nshared $h^{(n)}$. Equations: the order-$\\varepsilon^n$ residual of all four branches, jointly.\n\nGauge: $L_0$'s polynomial kernel is exactly the four untwisted $q_j$, so $Q_k^{(n)}$ is fixed only\nup to $\\sum_j c_j q_j$. Since $d_1<d_2<d_3<d_4$ and the $q_j$ are monic, killing the coefficient of\n$z^{d_j}$ in $Q_k^{(n)}$ for **all four** $j$ fixes it uniquely (triangular with unit diagonal).\n\n`slack` adds spare top coefficients so the ansatz degree is not assumed -- used below to *measure*\nthe true degree growth rather than impose it.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[baxCache, perturbOrder, qcof, hcof, pcof, TwistInit, PerturbQ, QSeries];\n\n(* cache the ported operator per (S,P,mu), sites substituted *)\nbaxCache[SS_, PP_, mu_] := baxCache[SS, PP, mu] = BaxTw[{SS, SS, 0, 0}, {PP, PP, 0, 0}, mu] /. wsub;\n\n(* order-0 data: untwisted Q's, and h^(0) from the Task-0 dictionary *)\nTwistInit[SS_, PP_, mu_] := Module[{q0, h0},\n   q0 = GaudinSolve[SS, PP, mu];\n   Do[qcof[SS, PP, mu, k, 0] = q0[[k]], {k, 4}];\n   pcof[SS, PP, mu, 0] = q0[[1]];   (* P_1^(0) = q_1, monic of degree M_1 = d_1 *)\n   h0 = (hUnknowns /. sol0[[1]]) /. {S -> SS, P -> PP, m1 -> mu[[1]], m2 -> mu[[2]], m3 -> mu[[3]], m4 -> mu[[4]]} /. wsub;\n   Do[hcof[SS, PP, mu, i, 0] = Simplify[h0[[i]]], {i, 9}];\n   {q0, h0}];\n\n(* ---- one order ----\n   BRANCH 1 IS RIGID.  d_1 = M_1 always (the (k-1) staggering vanishes at k=1), so branch 1\n   genuinely has Matteo's regular monic form Q_1 = Exp[-phi_1 z] P_1[z] with P_1 monic of degree\n   M_1.  That parametrization has no residual freedom, so branch 1 carries no gauge conditions;\n   its order-n unknowns are just the M_1 subleading coefficients of P_1^(n).\n   BRANCHES 2,3,4 have no such form (their degrees stagger), so they are gauge-fixed instead:\n   the polynomial kernel of L_0 is span{q_1..q_4}, monic of distinct degrees d_j, so killing the\n   coefficient of z^(d_j) for all four j removes every kernel component (triangular, unit diagonal).\n   A uniform ansatz degree d_4 + n keeps all four conditions imposable for every branch; any\n   coefficient above d_k + n is forced to zero by the equations rather than by assumption. *)\nperturbOrder[SS_, PP_, mu_, n_] := Module[\n   {ds, M1, deg, qser, hser, op, resid, eqs, gauge, unk, sol, q1n, qn, hn, p1n, pk},\n   ds = degQ[SS, PP, mu];\n   M1 = ds[[1]];\n   deg = ds[[4]] + n;\n   hser = Table[Sum[eps^m hcof[SS, PP, mu, i, m], {m, 0, n - 1}] + eps^n hh[i], {i, 9}];\n   op = baxCache[SS, PP, mu] /. Thread[hUnknowns -> hser];\n   (* branch 1: Q_1^(n) = Sum_b (-psi1 z)^(n-b)/(n-b)! * P_1^(b), P_1^(n) unknown (deg <= M1-1) *)\n   p1n = Sum[pp[j] z^j, {j, 0, M1 - 1}];\n   pk[b_] := If[b < n, Sum[pcof[SS, PP, mu, b][[j + 1]] z^j, {j, 0, Length[pcof[SS, PP, mu, b]] - 1}], p1n];\n   q1n = Expand[Sum[(-psi[1])^(n - b) z^(n - b)/(n - b)! pk[b], {b, 0, n}]];\n   qser[1][x_] := Sum[eps^m Sum[qcof[SS, PP, mu, 1, m][[j + 1]] x^j, {j, 0, Length[qcof[SS, PP, mu, 1, m]] - 1}], {m, 0, n - 1}] + eps^n (q1n /. z -> x);\n   Do[qser[k][x_] := Sum[eps^m Sum[qcof[SS, PP, mu, k, m][[j + 1]] x^j, {j, 0, Length[qcof[SS, PP, mu, k, m]] - 1}], {m, 0, n - 1}] + eps^n Sum[aa[k, j] x^j, {j, 0, deg}], {k, 2, 4}];\n   eqs = {};\n   Do[resid = Expand[Cancel[Together[z^4 (z - 1)^4 (op /. Q -> qser[k])]]];\n      eqs = Join[eqs, DeleteCases[Expand[CoefficientList[Coefficient[resid, eps, n], z]], 0]], {k, 4}];\n   gauge = Flatten[Table[aa[k, ds[[j]]], {k, 2, 4}, {j, 4}]];\n   unk = Join[Table[pp[j], {j, 0, M1 - 1}], Flatten[Table[aa[k, j], {k, 2, 4}, {j, 0, deg}]], Table[hh[i], {i, 9}]];\n   sol = Solve[Join[Thread[eqs == 0], Thread[gauge == 0]], unk];\n   If[Length[sol] =!= 1, Return[$Failed[\"branches\" -> Length[sol], \"order\" -> n]]];\n   pcof[SS, PP, mu, n] = Simplify[Table[pp[j], {j, 0, M1 - 1}] /. sol[[1]] /. pp[_] -> 0];\n   qcof[SS, PP, mu, 1, n] = Simplify[CoefficientList[q1n /. sol[[1]] /. pp[_] -> 0, z]];\n   Do[qcof[SS, PP, mu, k, n] = Simplify[Table[aa[k, j], {j, 0, deg}] /. sol[[1]] /. aa[_, _] -> 0], {k, 2, 4}];\n   hn = Table[Simplify[hh[i] /. sol[[1]] /. aa[_, _] -> 0 /. pp[_] -> 0], {i, 9}];\n   Do[hcof[SS, PP, mu, i, n] = hn[[i]], {i, 9}];\n   {Table[qcof[SS, PP, mu, k, n], {k, 4}], hn}];\n\nPerturbQ[SS_, PP_, mu_, nmax_] := Module[{r},\n   TwistInit[SS, PP, mu];\n   Do[r = perturbOrder[SS, PP, mu, n]; If[Head[r] === $Failed, Return[r, Module]], {n, nmax}];\n   {Table[Table[qcof[SS, PP, mu, k, n], {n, 0, nmax}], {k, 4}], Table[Table[hcof[SS, PP, mu, i, n], {n, 0, nmax}], {i, 9}]}];\n\nQSeries[SS_, PP_, mu_, nmax_] := Table[Sum[eps^n Sum[qcof[SS, PP, mu, k, n][[j + 1]] z^j, {j, 0, Length[qcof[SS, PP, mu, k, n]] - 1}], {n, 0, nmax}], {k, 4}];\n\nTwistInit[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}];\nr1 = perturbOrder[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}, 1];\nPrint[\"n=1 h corrections: \", r1[[2]]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">n=1 h corrections: </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:10.2em;vertical-align:-4.85em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:0.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span>