\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.26em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">psi</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: n=1 h corrections:[formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "8d3cc2c5-7cbb-4eb8-a60e-43eb503a4fbf"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Part 4 -- verification\n\n### 4a. Self-consistency\n\nTruncating the series at order $N$, the residual of the **twisted** operator must vanish through\norder $\\varepsilon^N$ for all four branches (first non-zero coefficient at $\\varepsilon^{N+1}$).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[residualOrders];\n\n(* orders 0..nmax of the twisted residual, per branch. Should be all-zero. *)\nresidualOrders[SS_, PP_, mu_, nmax_] := Module[{op, hser, qs},\n   hser = Table[Sum[eps^m hcof[SS, PP, mu, i, m], {m, 0, nmax}], {i, 9}];\n   op = baxCache[SS, PP, mu] /. Thread[hUnknowns -> hser];\n   qs = QSeries[SS, PP, mu, nmax];\n   Table[Module[{qf, resid},\n      qf[x_] := Evaluate[qs[[k]] /. z -> x];\n      resid = Expand[Cancel[Together[z^4 (z - 1)^4 (op /. Q -> qf)]]];\n      Table[Simplify[Coefficient[resid, eps, n]], {n, 0, nmax}]], {k, 4}]];\n\nnmax = 4;\nPerturbQ[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}, nmax];\nchk = residualOrders[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}, nmax];\nPrint[\"(S,P)=(1,1), mu={2,1,1,0}: residual orders 0..\", nmax, \" all vanish: \", AllTrue[Flatten[chk], # === 0 &]];\nPrint[\"first non-vanishing order (should be \", nmax + 1, \"): \",\n  Module[{op, hser, qs, qf, resid},\n   hser = Table[Sum[eps^m hcof[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}, i, m], {m, 0, nmax}], {i, 9}];\n   op = baxCache[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}] /. Thread[hUnknowns -> hser];\n   qs = QSeries[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}, nmax];\n   qf[x_] := Evaluate[qs[[4]] /. z -> x];\n   resid = Expand[Cancel[Together[z^4 (z - 1)^4 (op /. Q -> qf)]]];\n   Min[Select[Range[0, nmax + 3], Simplify[Coefficient[resid, eps, #]] =!= 0 &]]]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">(S,P)=(1,1), mu={2,1,1,0}: residual orders 0..</span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"NA==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> all vanish: </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: (S,P)=(1,1), mu={2,1,1,0}: residual orders 0..[formula] all vanish:[formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "66198fff-9c71-41c1-b7ce-7f33b6b2acf0"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">first non-vanishing order (should be </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"NQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">): </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"NQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: first non-vanishing order (should be[formula]):[formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "df49f6f0-b80d-4f5f-886b-18af44dab91a"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4b. Matteo's exact solve, for cross-validation\n\nHis ansatz: $Q_k = e^{-\\varphi_k z}\\,(z^{M_k}+\\sum_{j<M_k} c_k[j] z^j)$, $M_k = S+P-\\mu_k$, monic and\nfixed-degree. Unknowns: the $c_k[j]$ plus the same nine $h$'s -- his `SolveBaxAll`. Because the\nnormalization is completely fixed, this solve has **no** residual freedom, so it is what pins the\nconvention ambiguity we found above.\n\nConjugation is done exactly rather than by `Simplify`-ing exponentials: for\n$O=\\sum_j a_j D^j$ acting on $e^{rz}P$, $O[e^{rz}P]=e^{rz}\\sum_j a_j (D+r)^j P$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[opCoeffs, conjResid, MatteoSolve];\n\nopCoeffs[op_] := Table[If[j == 0, Coefficient[op, Q[z]], Coefficient[op, Derivative[j][Q][z]]], {j, 0, 4}];\n\n(* residual of O acting on Exp[r z] P[x], with the exponential stripped *)\nconjResid[op_, r_, pf_] := Module[{co = opCoeffs[op]},\n   Sum[co[[j + 1]] Sum[Binomial[j, i] r^(j - i) (D[pf[x], {x, i}] /. x -> z), {i, 0, j}], {j, 0, 4}]];\n\nMatteoSolve[SS_, PP_, mu_] := Module[{Ms, op, eqs, unk, sol, pf, resid},\n   Ms = SS + PP - mu;\n   op = BaxTw[{SS, SS, 0, 0}, {PP, PP, 0, 0}, mu] /. wsub;\n   eqs = {};\n   Do[pf[x_] := Evaluate[x^Ms[[k]] + Sum[cc[k, j] x^j, {j, 0, Ms[[k]] - 1}]];\n      resid = Expand[Cancel[Together[z^4 (z - 1)^4 conjResid[op, -eps psi[k], pf]]]];\n      eqs = Join[eqs, DeleteCases[Expand[CoefficientList[resid, z]], 0]], {k, 4}];\n   unk = Join[Flatten[Table[cc[k, j], {k, 4}, {j, 0, Ms[[k]] - 1}]], hUnknowns];\n   sol = Solve[Thread[eqs == 0], unk];\n   {Ms, Length[sol], sol}];\n\nmat = MatteoSolve[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}];\nPrint[\"M_k = \", mat[[1]], \"   (our d_k = \", degQ[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}], \", staggering = d-M = \", degQ[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}] - mat[[1]], \")\"];\nPrint[\"exact solution branches: \", mat[[2]]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">M_k = </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRcezAsMSwxLDJccmlnaHRcfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">   (our d_k = </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRcezAsMiwzLDVccmlnaHRcfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">, staggering = d-M = </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRcezAsMSwyLDNccmlnaHRcfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">)</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: M_k =[formula]   (our d_k =[formula], staggering = d-M =[formula])",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "961f2550-83c2-42f5-8f63-31eb3d5298fc"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">exact solution branches: </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"Mg==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: exact solution branches:[formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "c8d32973-a803-447e-b6c4-7f1a2ac4d5ce"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4c. Perturbative series vs Matteo's exact solve\n\nThe real test. Concrete rational $\\psi=\\{1,\\tfrac13,\\tfrac15,\\tfrac17\\}$ (his own twist values) so the\n`Sqrt` branch in the exact solve resolves unambiguously; `eps>0` assumed. Every order of our\n$h^{(n)}$ must agree with the $\\varepsilon$-expansion of his exact $h$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[matteoCompare];\n\nmatteoCompare[SS_, PP_, mu_, nmax_, psiv_] := Module[{ex, exs, ours, br, diffs},\n   ex = MatteoSolve[SS, PP, mu];\n   (* pick the exact branch whose eps->0 limit is our h^(0) *)\n   exs = Table[Simplify[PowerExpand[Simplify[(hUnknowns /. ex[[3]][[b]]) /. psiv, eps > 0]], eps > 0], {b, ex[[2]]}];\n   ours = Table[Sum[eps^n hcof[SS, PP, mu, i, n], {n, 0, nmax}] /. psiv, {i, 9}];\n   br = Select[Range[ex[[2]]], Simplify[(exs[[#]] /. eps -> 0) - (ours /. eps -> 0)] === Table[0, {9}] &];\n   If[br === {}, Return[\"no exact branch matches h^(0)\"]];\n   diffs = Table[Simplify[SeriesCoefficient[exs[[First[br]]], {eps, 0, n}] - SeriesCoefficient[ours, {eps, 0, n}]], {n, 0, nmax}];\n   {\"matching exact branch\" -> First[br], \"per-order differences\" -> diffs,\n    \"ALL ORDERS AGREE\" -> AllTrue[Flatten[diffs], # === 0 &]}];\n\npsiv = {psi[1] -> 1, psi[2] -> 1/3, psi[3] -> 1/5, psi[4] -> 1/7};\ncmp = matteoCompare[1, 1, {2, 1, 1, 0}, 4, psiv];\nPrint[cmp];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:10.8em;vertical-align:-5.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.56em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-10.06em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">matching exact branch</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.56em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" 