  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4d. Sweep over irreps\n\nEvery $\\mu$ in $[S,S,0,0]\\otimes[P,P,0,0]$, solved to order `nord` and residual-checked, with\nper-irrep timing -- in the style of `CheckAllIrreps` in `GaudinSolver.wb`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[SweepTwist];\n\nSweepTwist[SS_, PP_, nord_, irrList_] := Module[{tbl},\n   tbl = Table[Module[{mu = irrList[[i]], tim, r, ok},\n       {tim, r} = AbsoluteTiming[PerturbQ[SS, PP, mu, nord]];\n       ok = If[Head[r] === $Failed, False,\n          AllTrue[Flatten[residualOrders[SS, PP, mu, nord]], # === 0 &]];\n       {Row[mu, \",\"], dimGL4[mu], Row[degQ[SS, PP, mu], \",\"], NumberForm[tim, {6, 3}], ok}], {i, Length[irrList]}];\n   Print[\"(S,P)=(\", SS, \",\", PP, \")  order \", nord, \"  # irreps: \", Length[irrList],\n      \"   ALL PASS: \", AllTrue[tbl, Last], \"   total time (s): \", Total[tbl[[All, 4]] /. NumberForm[x_, _] :> x]];\n   Grid[Prepend[tbl, {\"mu\", \"dim\", \"deg Q\", \"time (s)\", \"ok?\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left,\n     Background -> {None, {RGBColor[.88, .95, .88], {GrayLevel[1], RGBColor[.96, .99, .96]}}}]];\n\nsweepResults = Table[Module[{ir = irreps[sp[[1]], sp[[2]]]},\n     {sp, SweepTwist[sp[[1]], sp[[2]], 2, ir]}], {sp, {{1, 1}, {2, 1}, {1, 2}, {2, 2}}}];\nsweepResults[[All, 2]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">(S,P)=(</span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"MQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">,</span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"MQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">)  order </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"Mg==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">  # irreps: </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"Mw==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">   ALL PASS: </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhybXtUcnVlfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">   total time (s): </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"NS4zNzk0OTI=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.379492</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: (S,P)=([formula],[formula])  order[formula]  # irreps:[formula]   ALL PASS:[formula]   total time (s):[formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
